* Components
I4 2 5 DC 0.1A
Q1 3 4 2 NPN
R1 1 3 3.6k
R2 2 5 4.7k
V1 1 0 DC 3V
V2 5 0 DC -3V

   * Nodes
   * 1 -> +3V
   * 2 -> Collector of Q1 and one end of R2, I4
   * 3 -> Base of Q1 and one end of R1
   * 4 -> Ground and emitter of Q1
   * 5 -> -3V and other end of R2, I4

   .model NPN NPN
   .end